<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35058" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναύλ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλή</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inside</i>
			<i>the court</i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναύλιος</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύρα</span>), ἡ, <i>the door leading into the house</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἐναύλιον ὠθῶν</span> pushing
			<i>it</i> open, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				1203.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναυλίαν</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωήν</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">
			ἄγοντες</span> the <i>inner life</i>, Zos.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.229B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναύλιον, τό</span>, <i>haunt, abode</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀστερόποιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Euph.
					51.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰοχεαίρης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					41.147
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
